            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# RunHuddle 0.13.3

- Moved Tool and Project filters beside search, with removable active-filter chips and Clear filters.
- Everywhere search includes saved and archived states while respecting explicit tool and project selections. Current view additionally restricts results to the selected sidebar view.
- Moved tracking setup notices beside Connections, keeping sidebar navigation focused on views.

Validation: native build, search scope regression tests, full release suite, standalone packaging and updater checks.
]]></description>
